{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y压缩了一些重要的心理转折和因果联系，尤其S07从短暂安心到突然恐惧的转变，以及S13即使始终没有人亲近也愿意好好生活的最终立场，X交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用关键词加亮和话语、感受交替的结构，让普通观众更容易迅速抓住每段叙事重点；感受又有具体的音乐时点，情绪变化比X更细腻、更有现场感。X的优势在于人物心理的因果解释更充分，前后转折交代得更完整，尤其结尾保留了不依赖他人也愿意好好生活的独立性。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，因为扫读效率、重点辨识和感受细腻度的提升更明显，但它确实牺牲了一部分叙事完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7361c6ba-35d4-44f2-b300-45492df4b95c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T071132424179Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.968, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:12:56.412612+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "25cd4128686caa8e1090fecf0ea63a1c6c8df9b6b1146a94028c738eb2502de5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool